o his favorite build then blew him up at the drop pod.", "timestamp_created": 1699485819, "timestamp_updated": 1699485819, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149783623", "author": {"steamid": "76561198197774339", "personaname": "Alice_is_puppy!", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198197774339/", "num_games_owned": 277, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 23281, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14358, "last_played": 1761325904, "avatar": "e65aa9009609fff0b0829a4fb7b42812f5461f23"}, "language": "english", "review": "While there have been a few rude people, this game has the most overwhelmingly positive community that I've had the pleasure of interacting with.\n\nGhost Ship Games has made an awesome game that really stands out to me as one with a soul, you can really tell that the developers care about this game, and they care about the community, often taking feedback from the community and actually doing what the community wants.\nThis game is engaging, the character building is incredibly in-depth and I've had a great time fine-tuning my builds. Even with a high-level, optimized character, the higher Hazard levels offer a consistently challenging, yet rewarding experience.\n\nThis game has been an obsession of mine since I was gifted it by a friend, I returned that favor by gifting it to two other people. I would very much so recommend Deep Rock to anybody with even an inkling of interest.", "timestamp_created": 1699485503, "timestamp_updated": 1699485503, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": fals